# W7, host a (k5): hosts in stag0101 with b; its link is cut (the proxy cuts a for 20 s: b sees the countdown, a's Digimon stands, a resumes, fingerprints equal).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
idle until epoch>=@195
idle until epoch>=@235
log a back
wander -150 -60 20 until sealed>=3000 fail stage=stagml11
log a played on as host
